      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Good grief, what a bind... never dreamed a\r\nLindwurm had nested in ruins\r\nsealed all these years—",
        "Jp" : "いやぁ、本当にまいったよ\r\nずっと封鎖してあった遺跡に\r\nまさかリンドブルムが棲みついてるなんて――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446124,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Thought to reseal it straight off, but... 'tis\r\nsaid dragons are wise, are they not? Moltova\r\nRuins and the well are connected... meaning the\r\nsecret's out, most like—",
        "Jp" : "すぐに封鎖しなおすことも考えたんだけど\r\n竜は知能が高いっていうだろ？\r\nモルトバ遺跡と井戸が繋がってるってことは\r\nもうバレちゃってると思うんだよ――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 481876,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If the Lindwurm means to come this way, relocking\r\nthe passage is naught but tossing water on hot stone.",
        "Jp" : "もしもリンドブルムがこっち側に出てくるつもりなら\r\n通路に鍵をかけ直したところで\r\n焼け石に水じゃないか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 481878,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "When I think about it that way, I just can't stop\r\nworrying— I don't think I'll be able to sleep\r\nuntil Ser Arisen goes to check on the situation...",
        "Jp" : "そう考えると気が気じゃないんだ――\r\n覚者さんに様子を見てきてもらうまでは\r\n眠れそうにないよ――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 481877,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1205,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "O'Neill",
      "Jp" : "オニール"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 17651,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
